        <briefdescription>
<para>SIGINT handler for interactive mode (at prompt). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>: Ctrl-C abandons the current input line, prints a newline, and redisplays a fresh prompt. The old text stays visible above.</para>
<para>We use rl_replace_line + rl_on_new_line + rl_redisplay to tell readline to clear its internal buffer and show a new prompt on the next line. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
